  "totalBlocks": 26,
  "translatedBlocks": 26,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "789203a8977a509a",
      "translationZh": "Claude 更高的使用限制以及与 SpaceX 的计算合作",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86449be6176fd334",
      "translationZh": "我们已与SpaceX达成合作伙伴关系，这将大幅提升我们的计算能力。再加上我们近期的其他计算合作，使得我们能够提升Claude Code和Claude API的使用上限。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7e045b551c909b6",
      "translationZh": "下面，我们描述这些变化以及我们在计算方面取得的进展。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ecd22a3731d1cc2",
      "translationZh": "以下三项自今日起生效的更改旨在提升我们最忠实客户使用 Claude 时的体验。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c211ab0e4fa0679a",
      "translationZh": "首先，我们将 Claude Code 的五小时速率限制在专业版、最高版、团队版以及基于席位的企业版计划中翻倍。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "287fae96767acd70",
      "translationZh": "其次，我们正在取消对专业版和最高版账户的 Claude Code 在高峰时段的额度限制减免。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c0c9470b001f6b0",
      "translationZh": "第三，我们大幅提升了 Claude Opus 模型的 API 调用速率限制，如下表所示：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddd6d1c0545b2714",
      "translationZh": "我们更新的 Claude Opus 模型的 API 速率限制。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "df24ba0e1a025da2",
      "translationZh": "与SpaceX的新计算合作",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad47b0bc2e80171f",
      "translationZh": "我们已与SpaceX签署协议，使用其Colossus 1数据中心的全部计算资源。这使我们在本月内获得超过300兆瓦的新算力（超过220,000块NVIDIA GPU）。这部分新增算力将直接提升Claude Pro和Claude Max订阅用户的使用容量。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6479f0520de9e6af",
      "translationZh": "这加入了我们其他重要的算力公告：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "990d4f551b7ecd49",
      "translationZh": "与 Amazon 达成的最高 5 gigawatt (GW) 协议，其中包括到 2026 年底的近 1 GW 新增容量；",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cac75958829f46f1",
      "translationZh": "与 Google 和 Broadcom 达成的 5 GW 协议，将于 2027 年开始上线；",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2176e0bad66d8fb5",
      "translationZh": "与 Microsoft 和 NVIDIA 的战略合作伙伴关系，包含 30 亿的 Azure 容量；",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e2a2eaf9b8b1dd77",
      "translationZh": "我们与 Fluidstack 合作的 50 亿投资用于美国 AI 基础设施。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ee33fcfebc8f417",
      "translationZh": "我们在多种 AI 硬件上训练和运行 Claude——AWS Trainium、Google TPUs 和 NVIDIA GPU——并继续探索将更多容量上线的机会。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1a8a4b0391663d5",
      "translationZh": "作为此协议的一部分，我们还表达了与 SpaceX 合作开发多吉瓦轨道 AI 算力容量的兴趣。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0c3a8c4999649516",
      "translationZh": "国际扩张",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e74c813a0093cea7",
      "translationZh": "我们的企业客户——尤其是金融服务、医疗和政府等受监管行业的客户——日益需要本地基础设施以满足合规和数据驻留要求。因此，我们的部分容量扩张将是国际性的：我们最近宣布与亚马逊的合作包括在亚洲和欧洲增加推理。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a0a0771cc1a3039",
      "translationZh": "我们在决定何处增加容量方面非常用心——与那些法律和监管框架支持此规模投资的民主国家合作，并且我们的计算所依赖的供应链——硬件、网络和设施——将保持安全。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3307bdf8acb85dcd",
      "translationZh": "最后，我们最近承诺承担美国数据中心导致的任何消费者电价上涨。作为我们国际扩张的一部分，我们正在探索将该承诺扩展到新司法管辖区的方法，并与当地领导人合作，回馈宿主我们设施的社区。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1f9dba38b243ff21",
      "translationZh": "与客户共同开发企业前沿防护措施",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ab0b3c438a481733",
      "translationZh": "改进我们的一致性和安全工作",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a81a773d6c9c8b6",
      "translationZh": "7月30日，我们报告了三起Claude模型未经授权访问真实计算机系统的事件。我们正在对这两起事件进行深入分析，并计划与METR合作进行独立审查。与此同时，我们正在分享过去一个月所做的一些更改。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "db493008cb1b8f03",
      "translationZh": "预览模型硬件标准",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f8f8f0257b53b65",
      "translationZh": "我们正在向一批科学研究实验室和先进制造商开放模型硬件标准（MHS）的研究预览，这是一个用于AI代理安全操作物理设备的共享规范。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
